---@class cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequest
---@field account_id string Identifier.
---@field Prefer? string
---@field domain_name string Provides a fully qualified domain name (FQDN), including the extension (e.g., `example.com`, `mybrand.app`). The domain name uniquely identifies a registration. Cloudflare permits only one registration per domain, making the domain name a natural idempotency key for registration requests.
---@field acknowledgements? cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequestAcknowledgementsMap Provides user acknowledgements for a specific extension or premium registration flow. The extension registration schema from the extension discovery endpoint identifies the required keys.
---@field auto_renew? boolean Enable or disable automatic renewal. Defaults to `false` if omitted. Setting this field to `true` is an explicit opt-in authorizing Cloudflare to charge the account's default payment method up to 30 days before domain expiry to renew the domain automatically. Renewal pricing may change over time based on registry pricing.
---@field contact_extensions? cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequestContactExtensionsMap Provides registry-specific contact extension values for the registrant. `GET /accounts/{account_id}/registrar/extensions/{extension}` identifies the required keys and allowed values for each extension in the `registration_schema.properties.contact_extensions` object.
---@field contacts? cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequestContacts Provides contact data for the registration request.
---@field privacy_mode? cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequestPrivacyMode|string Sets the WHOIS privacy mode for the registration. Defaults to `redaction`.
---@field years? number Sets the registration term from 1 to 10 years. When omitted, this field defaults to the registry's minimum registration period for the extension. Most extensions require 1 year, while some require longer minimum terms (e.g., `.ai` requires 2 years).

---@alias cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequestAcknowledgementsMap { [string]: any }

---@alias cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.CreateRegistrationRequestContactExtensionsMap { [string]: any }

