---@field currency string ISO-4217 currency code for the prices (e.g., "USD", "EUR", "GBP").
---@field registration_cost string The first-year cost to register this domain.
---@field renewal_cost string Per-year renewal cost for this domain. Applied to each year beyond the first year of a multi-year registration, and to each annual auto-renewal thereafter. May differ from `registration_cost`, especially for premium domains where initial registration often costs more than renewals.

---@alias cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.SearchResponseDomainsItemReason "extension_not_supported_via_api"|"extension_not_supported"|"extension_disallows_registration"|"domain_premium"|"domain_unavailable"

---@alias cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.SearchResponseDomainsItemTier "standard"|"premium"

---@alias cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.SearchResponseDomainsList cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.SearchResponseDomainsItem[]

---@class cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetRequest
---@field account_id string Identifier.
---@field domain_name string Provides a fully qualified domain name (FQDN), including the extension (e.g., `example.com`, `mybrand.app`). The domain name uniquely identifies a registration. Cloudflare permits only one registration per domain, making the domain name a natural idempotency key for registration requests.

---Unwrapped `result` payload of the Cloudflare v4 response envelope.
---@class cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponse
---@field completed boolean Indicates whether the workflow reached a terminal state. A `succeeded` or `failed` state returns `true`; `pending`, `in_progress`, `action_required`, and `blocked` return `false`.
---@field created_at string
---@field links cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseLinks
---@field state cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseState Describes the workflow lifecycle state.
---@field updated_at string
---@field context? cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseContextMap|distilled.Null Provides workflow-specific data.
---@field error? cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseError|distilled.Null Provides error details when a workflow reaches the `failed` state. The workflow type (registration, update, etc.) and underlying registry response determine the specific codes and messages. Workflow error codes differ from immediate HTTP error `errors[].code` values in non-2xx responses. Surface `error.message` to the user for context.

---@alias cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseContextMap { [string]: any }

---@class cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseError
---@field code string Machine-readable error code identifying the failure reason.
---@field message string Human-readable explanation of the failure. May include registry-specific details.

---@class cloudflare.registrar_sandbox.UpdateStatusGetResponseLinks
---@field self string URL to this status resource.
---@field resource? string|distilled.Null URL to the domain resource.

